                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>No minutes of this meeting have been found. The information set forth above is
                    from the Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg658">p.
                        658</ref>. At the beginning of the tripartite meeting, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">infra</hi>, Roosevelt summarized what he had said at this meeting with
                        Inönü.</p>
            </div>
